  "summary": "Adds explicit `#include <util/check.h>` across test, fuzz, and benchmark files containing assertion calls, and removes now-redundant `#include <cassert>` lines via scripted diff. It also allows `clang-format` to be invoked during scripted-diff verification in CI linting to sort the updated include blocks.",
